@startuml Users Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Users — administration and self-service

actor "Admin / Account owner" as Client
participant "UserController / ProfileController" as Controller
participant "Operation-focused UserService" as Service
database "MySQL\nUser + media repositories" as Repository
participant "Teacher / Coordinator ProfileService" as RoleProfile
participant "Media + Notification services" as SideEffects
participant "AWS S3" as S3

Client -> Controller : admin CRUD or own profile/password/image
Controller -> Service : authenticated user + validated DTO

alt Admin changes role or active state
  Service -> Repository : update account
  Service -> RoleProfile : create/remove role profile or mirror active state
  note right of RoleProfile
    Deactivation preserves the profile and club link.
    Role change removes the old profile and creates the new one.
  end note
else Own profile, password or image
  Service -> Repository : load and update own account
  Service -> SideEffects : replace image safely when supplied
  SideEffects -> S3 : upload replacement; delete old object after persistence
end

Service -> SideEffects : send account notice in background when applicable
Service --> Client : explicit response DTO
@enduml
